<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A GUIDE WITH SOURCES</view><view class="title">每一段故事，
都有来处。</view><view class="subtle">文化背景与历史活动可查证；
当天开放、费用与课程另行确认。</view><view class="field"><input placeholder="搜索古村、工艺或片区…" bindinput="search"/></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id"><view class="eyebrow">{{item.zone}} / {{item.category}}</view><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="tag">开放与体验待确认</view><view class="subtle field">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="source-item" wx:for="{{item.sources}}" wx:for-item="source" wx:key="url"><view>{{source.title}}</view><view class="small">资料核验 {{source.checked}}</view><view class="link" data-url="{{source.url}}" bindtap="copy">复制官方来源链接 ↗</view></view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choose">围绕这里安排一天</button></view><view wx:if="{{!error && filtered.length === 0}}" class="notice">没有匹配的资料，试试其他关键词。</view></view>
